  "about_item": [
    "Slow Feeder For Medium & Large Dogs: Measuring 6.1 x 1.2 inches, this interactive dog toys holds up 1.5 cups of dry or wet food. Its internal ring design enables effortless food loading while effectively slowing eating pace. Promotes proper chewing rhythm and healthy eating habits for improved digestion. An ideal slow-feeding toy for medium and large breeds",
    "Dog Toys to Keep Them Busy: Freeze peanut butter or greek yogurt inside this enrichment toy to create lasting mental stimulation. The cold texture provides therapeutic gum stimulation, combating boredom & separation anxiety. An ideal frozen lick mat delivering continuous sensory engagement—keeping dogs calmly occupied for hours alone and promoting emotional stability",
    "Natural Rubber: This interactive dog toys are made from indestructible natural rubber, are built to last, saving you cash and cutting down on environmental waste. Say goodbye to endless toy replacements, and choose the sustainable option. Safe for your pet's health. Trust in food-safe, toxin-free natural rubber dog toys",
    "Easy to Clean & Dishwasher Safe: Just rinse or toss in the dishwasher. Made of Natural Rubber that won’t crack, warp, or hold odors even with daily washing. Stays durable for safety, saves you scrubbing time",
    "Lifetime Replacement: Pawnana is a small business, and all dog toys are designed in the USA. But we believe our dog toys should be built to last. If your Pawnana toy doesn't last as long as you think it should, one-time replacement. No shipping anything. Back, no hassles"
  ],
